{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And the priest waves them.</b> Together with the two lambs of the peace-offerings of Atzeret." "<b>On the bread of the first-fruits.</b> Together with the bread of the first-fruits." "<b>On the two lambs.</b> Adjacent to the two lambs, as we learned in the chapter Kol HaMenachot: how does he do it? He places the two loaves beside the two lambs and waves." "<b>Holy they shall be to YHWH.</b> To the priest, and no stranger eats of them, as one eats from the rest of peace-offerings."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:36.923261221Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}